IMGEP curiosity exploration of the Dexed (DX7) preset parameter space, without SpinVAE2's
decoder in the loop -- the "curiosity alone" baseline, to be compared against the human-preset
dataset coverage (see spinvae2/notebooks/dexed_audit_TT_ACTM.ipynb).

Theta: 155 raw Dexed VST parameters (144 learnable, 11 fixed to spinvae2 defaults).
Rendering: DawDreamer-backed Dexed engine reused from spinvae2 (synth.dexed.Dexed), one fixed
reference MIDI note (pitch=56, velocity=75), matching the whole spinvae2 dataset.
Z: AudioCommons Timbral Models (ACTM) features only, computed in-process (no MATLAB) for
speed. Full TT+ACTM (38 canonical features) is recomputed offline on discovered presets only.

Requires the spinvae2 repo checked out at ~/projects/spinvae2, and (for rendering):
  export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/data/anasynth_nonbp/manaconda3/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH
